            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Bouncebin 1.0.7</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Fixed: if Bouncebin was ever force-quit, the part of it that does the
      work stayed running in the background. A later copy would find the port
      taken, move aside, and you could end up talking to the old one &#8212;
      which showed up as <b>Import database</b> failing for no visible
      reason.</li>
  <li>Bouncebin now clears up anything it left behind when it starts, and
      shuts down properly when you quit.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
